
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Forgot Password</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 80px auto;
            padding: 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        h2 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #1e293b;
        }

        p {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .otp {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            background-color: #eff6ff;
            color: #2563eb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <h2>Reset Your Password</h2>
        <p>Hello <%= name %>, we received a request to reset you password</p>
        <p> Use the OTP below to reset your password.</p>
        <h3 class="otp"><%= OTP %></h3>
        <p>This OTP is valid for a limited time <%= expirationMinutes %> minutes.Please do not share it with anyone. If you did not request a password reset, Please ignoe this email.</p>
        <div class="footer">
            © 2026 Ohline-Healthcare. All rights reserved.
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>

